    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I learned later that the poison was Julienne's idea. That they made a targeted attack against the Barleys and Rouxs. Bac",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1256
        }
      ],
      "words": 50
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Cinnamon: Hey! I need your help! You seemed to know about crypto and my last job is trying to pay me with bitcoin (???).",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1891
        }
      ],
      "words": 71
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I still need to track down the owner of the card",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2359
        },
        {
          "text": "maybe it would lead me to who Cinnamon actually is. Maybe a police report was filed, and it's flagged stolen",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2408
        },
        {
          "text": "Cinnamon seems so innocent, sweet even. And yet",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2517
        },
        {
          "text": "I go into her email, finding she still hasn't changed her password. I quickly read through the messages",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2566
        },
        {
          "text": "At some point, I will have to turn her in. To end this charade. But not yet",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2723
